  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3ff6acaa8b9f1994499dd387e6188532, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Comments: This scene demonstrates the use of Place On Path to place objects on
    an existing Motion Path or Flyby path. Objects may be placed relative to the
    current path interpolation, or freely placed anywhere along the path. This behavior
    is useful not only for animated objects but also for scene building and placing
    items relative to path nodes.
  Warning: 
  URLTitle: Place On Path Documentation
  URL: https://axongenesis.gitbook.io/timeflow/reference/behaviors/automation/place-on-path
  URL2Title: 
  URL2: 
